{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Warcraft Reborn: Reborn Slam, Charge and Holy Shock ranks keep their own rank's results",
  "contract": [
    "Reborn chains (1100000 + the stock id) carry no Ascension-inserted ranks, so rank N of a Reborn chain is not rank N of the stock chain once SpellRank.dbc inserts a stock rank. Scripts map the rank inside the twin chain (SpellMgr::GetSpellWithRankFor): Reborn Holy Shock 1120929/1120930 cast 1125911/1125902 and heal with 1125913/1125903, not the stock 25911/25902 or the inserted stock rank 25915. Reborn Slam 1101465-1101467 and 1108820 cast 1150783; Reborn Charge 1106178 and 1111578 generate rage."
  ],
